      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>HC18 训练样例 002_HC.png：胎头呈类椭圆回声结构</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 右侧三卡 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>发育监测的核心参数</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>头围（HC）反映胎儿脑发育情况，与双顶径、股骨长共同构成产前生长评估体系，用于核对孕周、筛查小头畸形与巨头等生长异常。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>测量依赖标准平面</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>规范测法要求在丘脑平面获取胎头横切面，沿颅骨外缘描绘椭圆并读取周长——平面的获取与描迹都依赖医师经验。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
